{
 "_readme": [
  "CURATED per-card source bindings — the ONLY hand-maintained input to the",
  "card-level half of the resource map. `scripts/gen_recording_map.py` reads",
  "this, enumerates each card's item keys FROM the contract (the authoritative",
  "list of which card fields exist), expands `columns_tuple` from",
  "engine.contract, and emits the `cards` block of references/section_sources.json.",
  "",
  "A card here refines the SECTION's source with card-grain detail; anything",
  "omitted inherits the section (disposition, report_sections, enrichment).",
  "  tab            the primary workbook tab a workbook-fed card is read from",
  "  also_tabs      secondary workbook tabs feeding the same card",
  "  columns_tuple  the engine.contract COLUMN tuple naming that tab's columns",
  "  report_sections  the report section(s) that shape an authored card",
  "  enrichment_facet the enrichment_register facet, for enriched cards",
  "  disposition    override the section's disposition for this card",
  "  floor          the rulebook's count/floor for the card array",
  "  r_layer_per_item  the card requires an r_layer on every item",
  "  connector_authored the connector writes this card at submit (NOT the agent)",
  "  computed_never_sent  item keys the app computes; a producer must not send",
  "  nested         per nested sub-card overrides, when its source differs",
  "",
  "The generator ASSERTS the bound card set equals the contract's list-of-object",
  "fields (grids and object_nested named explicitly), so a card added to the",
  "contract fails the build until it is bound here."
 ],
 "grids": {
  "heatmap.workbook_scores": {
   "pillars": {"tab": "Pillar_Rollup", "columns_tuple": "PILLAR_ROLLUP_COLUMNS",
               "also_tabs": ["Pillar_Summary", "Peer_Benchmarks"],
